{75}{I am certain you are familiar with the scorn heaped upon those such as yourself, being of partial orcish blood. Imagine what it must be like for me in this life, being treated as a full blooded orc. Though this may seem demeaning, it is better than being spit on in the streets, or being no more than a slave in a factory.}{I am certain you are familiar with the scorn heaped upon those such as yourself, being of partial orcish blood. Imagine what it must be like for me in this life, being treated as a full blooded orc. Though this may seem demeaning, it is better than being spit on in the streets, or being no more than a slave in a factory.}{}{8}{}{}
