{530}{Oh, yes, of course. Please excuse my ramblings. [He pauses to look around.] Well, on the southwest side of town there's the boil. [He shudders, involuntarily.] Disgusting place. Filled with Orcs and other refuse. And then, of course, up in the northeast we have the upper classes.}{Oh, yes, of course. Please excuse my ramblings. [He pauses to look around.] Well, on the southwest side of town there's the boil. [He shudders, involuntarily.] Disgusting place. Filled with Orcs and other refuse. And then, of course, up in the northeast we have the upper classes.}{}{41}{}{}
